Description: Stochastic Fractal Search SQLite loadable extension (Community)
 sqlite3-fractalsql is a SQLite loadable extension exposing the full
 FractalSQL 2.0 surface — fractal_search/fractal_search_explore retrieval, the
 fractal_vector BLOB type with vector math, sovereign-tier agents
 (fractal_reason, fractal_text_to_sql, fractal_embed, the vectorizer),
 fractal dimension analysis, and the QTL ledger — statically linked
 against the vendored pure-C FractalSQL core.
 .
 Community Edition (v2.0.0): Salimi 2014 canonical SFS with Gaussian
 diffusion and greedy sniper selection; sovereign-tier features drive
 an optional reasoning plugin (fractalsql-reasoning-http).
 .
 Zero runtime dependency beyond glibc: the core archive is statically
 linked into the extension; the only import is libc (plus libdl for
 plugin loading and libm/libpthread, per the linker line).
 .
 After installation, load the extension in any SQLite session:
 .
     SELECT load_extension('/usr/local/lib/sqlite3/fractalsql');
 .
 Suitable for edge / serverless deployments (Vercel, AWS Lambda),
 Turso / libSQL, Cloudflare D1 (where extensions are permitted),
 React Native / Flutter mobile apps, and desktop SQLite usage.